TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water, equilibrated with O2(g) and allowing Goethite, Gypsum precipitation; report SI Hematite
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    O2(g) -0.7

REACTION 1
    Pyrite 1
    0.1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -si Hematite
END
